{"id":100780826993861,"name":"tap the egg","desc":"THANK YOU FOR 150,000 VISITS! NEW UPDATE COMING SOON.\n\nTHIS GAME IS A WORK IN PROGRESS. IF YOU HAVE ANY SUGGESTIONS OR WANT TO REPORT BUGS, PLEASE VISIT THE GROUP PAGE. THANK YOU\n\nhow to play egg\ntap egg\nbuy upgrade\nbuy pet\nget a lot of tap\nrebirth to multiply many tap\nsell egg for yolkcoin or robuck**\ndone\n\n*Note: To tap offline you must purchase the Auto Tapper Gamepass. Additionally, some gamepasses may require you to rejoin to work!\n\n**Robux purchases for eggs are made in-game. Create a dev product for your egg to list it for robux. Go to https://create.roblox.com/dashboard/creations , and click on an experience. Scroll down to the monetization section and click on \"Developer Products.\" Set the product to the price you want to sell the item for and enter the id of the product in settings.\nThis allows players to donate to you for your eggs! If you are buying with robux, you must leave and rejoin to see your newly acquired egg.\n\nCredits:\nArt by @Lindted\nProgramming by @tfey6","path":"/game/100780826993861-tap-the-egg","slug":"100780826993861-tap-the-egg","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ff160326217183ceeeb509ef38741a1691e1978bfb6b79de5d996a29f79f1d70.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-505be4b550714067a94080ac49d1b2ba/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":298146,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-19T10:22:46.317Z","creator":{"name":"Extremely Online Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"68cd2ef6d7a3db4456a87924","title":"inf money","game":{"_id":"68cd2ef6d7a3db4456a87921","gameId":100780826993861,"name":"tap the egg","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/47760aa17a8cfb1882b3d4f83f66fb6f4edd58e5a72d7288045b42ca3dfb8819.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-cca22787b853f968a51b675427d95236-1154a68fcc7f.png"},"slug":"100